{"title":"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If P is a polynomial that satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/895bdaa58c998cf42adde32ffab45d7e18bb55e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x^2 +1) = 5x^4 +7x^2 +19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"217\" height=\"19\" />, then what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />? (Hint: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is quadratic.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/b/64ba256813de19a6f859801a886d8e7f1af9568a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)=ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"161\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b40a54cf86e40d3ea4e80dfd2040e8d9e3d18fc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x^2+1)^2+b(x^2+1)+c=ax^4+2ax^2+a+bx^2+b+c=5x^4+7x^2+19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"597\" height=\"21\" />. By matching coefficients (the coefficients of each power of x on both sides must be equal), we derive the system <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/53897e4b47f6049266b4bffcef91bc949385b5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/a/9fa83523de242d2f4d04e024000366360bdeb0c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+b=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />,and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/6/4e63bf06114e0fb41f6c61da2222fc42dbfb9d15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" />, from which we see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/8105e3c5c51d4993f54c2230802c23511ad2a06f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/3260cfa7dbb20221570746ffaa8535be8e3824dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb59835cd2a321317560ff30b7c2da12b8495a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)=\\boxed{5x^2-3x+17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"185\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II\">2015 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017005606\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 113/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 94/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2024/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.937      1 Template:UNCO_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%    6.937      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13905:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017005606 and revision id 216509. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}